{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>The anointed priests.</b> This did not recur in later generations, for indeed no ordinary priest was ever anointed after them during the lifetime of the High Priest. The reason that their hands were filled to serve — which then required anointing — is that without it they would not have been priests at all, since they were born before Aaron was chosen to the priesthood, as happened with Phinehas before he slew Zimri."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:29.569852602Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}